  "lines": {
    "Clip one. Watch for the hazard.": "audio/9fa40eb954be.mp3",
    "A single file is forming right in front of you. What do you do?": "audio/c2ffb49d6a20.mp3",
    "That's the Single File. One at a time, five deep, while nineteen feet of bar sits empty.": "audio/d5d196f4d3f7.mp3",
    "Correct. Point along the bar. Spread out, I'll come to you. Now you can see everyone, and so can the rest of the staff.": "audio/d43875857286.mp3",
    "Congratulations. You've built a post office. A bar is not a post office.": "audio/db06b7e023f8.mp3",
    "The Guinness has to settle. Someone else is waiting. What do you do?": "audio/3a442729cc42.mp3",
    "It settles without supervision. Meanwhile someone's been stood at the bar for two minutes, watching you watch a pint.": "audio/9315bbe58278.mp3",
    "They will notice. Everyone notices. Flat pint, long stare, bad review.": "audio/8e949820b168.mp3",
    "Correct. A Guinness settles on its own. Your hands are free, so take the next order while it does.": "audio/86f79df9db30.mp3",
    "Two people waiting. Who do you serve next?": "audio/b3b32d860b33.mp3",
    "Correct. The right one arrived first. You clocked them before you turned, and watched the middle one arrive in the mirror. Give the middle one a nod.": "audio/efdcfd956263.mp3",
    "Nearest is not next. The right one was here first. You saw them arrive before you turned round.": "audio/ff8b0f276396.mp3",
    "That's how you train a whole pub to wave. Never reward the tenner-waver.": "audio/67c8aa598020.mp3",
    "The card machine is connecting. Someone's waiting. What do you do?": "audio/82fd08fb3c03.mp3",
    "Staring doesn't help. It never has. Meanwhile someone on the right is holding a tenner and losing faith.": "audio/6faa33234a5a.mp3",
    "Correct. Hand it over, turn your head, take the next order. The machine doesn't need supervising.": "audio/ef48bff73de3.mp3",
    "And there it is. A single file, started by you, from behind the bar.": "audio/6b6f72025ef8.mp3",
    "Six drinks. One of them is a Guinness. What do you pour first?": "audio/ea5330e98a35.mp3",
    "Then five lagers go flat while the Guinness settles at the end, and everyone waits for the last pint.": "audio/5ad935ada4a5.mp3",
    "The freshest Guinness in London, and five warm lagers. Nobody has ever said thank you for that.": "audio/019994441252.mp3",
    "Correct. Guinness first. It settles while you pour the other five, and everything's ready at once.": "audio/4d353b2ef5e7.mp3",
    "Someone's waving a tenner at you. Who do you serve?": "audio/8d22407d4f01.mp3",
    "Reward one tenner and the whole pub learns to wave. By nine o'clock it looks like a semaphore convention.": "audio/8cbe3aea9ed0.mp3",
    "Now nobody gets a drink. The quiet one was here first, and their only crime is standing there nicely.": "audio/4ecdc14520bc.mp3",
    "Correct. The quiet one was here first, so serve them. Then tell the tenner they're next. Waving gets you served at exactly the same time as not waving.": "audio/33d8500ace6a.mp3",
    "Someone's hovering a metre back from the bar. What do you do?": "audio/5cc2e924815b.mp3",
    "Correct. That's The Hoverer. They came in before the one at the bar, so wave them into the gap and serve them next. Hovering is not a queue.": "audio/11467393574e.mp3",
    "They do want a drink. They were here first. They're just waiting to be invited in, like a vampire.": "audio/35b12fecc1c1.mp3",
    "They won't. A Hoverer can hover until closing. Some of them have been there since 2020.": "audio/f0ca878555e3.mp3",
    "There's a queue by the toilets. The bar is empty. What do you do?": "audio/e639c21672bb.mp3",
    "They don't. They think the bar is at the end of that queue. It isn't. It's a toilet.": "audio/27f4bc1c0a9d.mp3",
    "Correct. That's the Phantom Queue. A queue with no bar at the end of it. Call them over before it reaches the pool table.": "audio/dc63414a3d8c.mp3",
    "It goes to the toilet. You've left an empty bar to queue for the loo. The landlord would like a word.": "audio/6757b2ab7177.mp3",
    "You and a colleague are both going for the same customer. What do you do?": "audio/1f9fb6b77bd4.mp3",
    "Correct. Call it out loud and split the bar. Two staff, two customers, and nobody saying hello to an empty bit of bar.": "audio/135e0f6a7366.mp3",
    "Two people taking one order isn't double the service. It's half. And the one on the right is still saying hello.": "audio/f2d9f35ecdd2.mp3",
    "Very competitive. Very fast. Meanwhile the customer on the right has started their own petition.": "audio/c1e72438498c.mp3",
    "They're asking their table what everyone wants. What do you do?": "audio/4871a313e347.mp3",
    "They were first to the bar, and they'll be last to decide. Meanwhile the next customer is visibly ageing.": "audio/cae394c116a8.mp3",
    "Bold. Efficient. Now someone at that table is drinking a lager they didn't want, very slowly, while staring at you.": "audio/029ba76447e4.mp3",
    "Correct. That's The Round. What are you having is a question for the table, not the bar. Serve the next one while they find out, then go back.": "audio/4270f96db4aa.mp3",
    "You scored 0 out of 5. Barred. From behind the bar. Read the Bar Rule again.": "audio/630ac3f5e200.mp3",
    "You scored 1 out of 5. Barred. From behind the bar. Read the Bar Rule again.": "audio/32a4338c41a4.mp3",
    "You scored 2 out of 5. Glass collector. Back to the dishwasher for now.": "audio/c10923bd9e57.mp3",
    "You scored 3 out of 5. Bar staff. Eyes up. Let the Guinness settle on its own.": "audio/adc3264a4ee3.mp3",
    "You scored 4 out of 5. Head bartender. One slip. Nobody noticed. Probably.": "audio/84bd8cfa5b81.mp3",
    "You scored 5 out of 5. Landlord material. You see everyone. You serve them in order. Nobody queues.": "audio/3172b3754295.mp3",
    "There's a queue. Most of the bar is empty. What do you do?": "audio/a91523dc6307.mp3",
    "That's the Single File. You've just made it longer. One barperson works. The other three watch.": "audio/74a676525bb0.mp3",
    "Correct. Walk to the bar. Not behind someone. To the bar. Three staff were standing idle.": "audio/a7e0a46dede9.mp3",
    "That's The Hoverer. You're not in a queue. You're in the way. Step in.": "audio/a156311b8fe0.mp3",
    "The barperson looks your way. What do you do?": "audio/3e4917f3b96d.mp3",
    "No waving. No clicking. They're a barperson, not a spaniel.": "audio/9c5b569407d9.mp3",
    "They can't serve someone who isn't there. Eyes up. Catching an eye is the whole system.": "audio/e0944373a1a5.mp3",
    "Correct. A nod, a raised eyebrow, a tenner held with quiet confidence. That's all it takes.": "audio/82d28637193c.mp3",
    "They got there first. The barperson says you're next. What do you do?": "audio/2ada6ccbbf59.mp3",
    "You weren't. And even if you were, the barperson knows. Do not test them.": "audio/ab7348a250cc.mp3",
    "Correct. They know who's next. They always know. It's their entire job.": "audio/7800b46dd671.mp3",
    "And now you've started a queue. Someone will join it. Then it never ends.": "audio/21961c5a77e5.mp3",
    "You're buying for six. They ask what you're having. What do you do?": "audio/5ec0d337dde8.mp3",
    "\"What are you having\" is a question for the table. Not the bar. Everyone behind you just aged a year.": "audio/a8a1d28046a7.mp3",
    "That's six trips. It's not a round. It's a relay.": "audio/e0ddc8d71467.mp3",
    "Correct. Know the order before you get to the bar. Four lagers, a Guinness, and a lime and soda. Done.": "audio/b347c30de810.mp3",
    "There's a long line by the pool table. The bar's empty. What do you do?": "audio/62164a51ba7c.mp3",
    "It isn't. That's a Phantom Queue. There's no bar at the end of it. It's for the pool table. Wrong kind of cue.": "audio/a079f2eac553.mp3",
    "They don't know. Nobody knows. That's what makes it a Phantom Queue. Meanwhile, four staff are standing behind an empty bar.": "audio/26ba1fa74d82.mp3",
    "Correct. Follow the bar, not the queue. Four staff, nobody being served. That line was for the pool table.": "audio/630746ad4ec3.mp3",
    "Someone's just lined up right behind you. What do you do?": "audio/38090e1a452a.mp3",
    "Correct. Point at the gap. Side by side is a cluster. One behind the other is the start of a queue.": "audio/a779bcd5302e.mp3",
    "Queues are polite in a post office. This is a pub. Give it ten minutes and that line reaches the door.": "audio/f716c1205d00.mp3",
    "A tut is not a policy. It's a noise. Use your words. Or at least your finger.": "audio/de8c068a1bb8.mp3",
    "You've got your drinks. People are waiting for a gap. What do you do?": "audio/3fa376c7351d.mp3",
    "You earned a drink. The spot was on loan. The bar is for ordering, not for living.": "audio/0e3c35aa9c32.mp3",
    "Correct. Served means done. Take your drinks, free the gap. Someone behind you has been very patient.": "audio/8c53e5155e26.mp3",
    "They're lovely. They're also working. Two people behind you would like a turn at lovely.": "audio/73e30e9f7414.mp3",
    "The barperson asks who is next. They were here before you. What do you do?": "audio/87db991ea0d1.mp3",
    "Correct. They were first, so point at them. The Cluster runs on honesty. And you are next anyway.": "audio/2b54cb9b7fd6.mp3",
    "Technically fast. Morally slow. The barperson saw that. They always see that.": "audio/482c864fc4a1.mp3",
    "Silence isn't an answer. It's a delay. And somebody is still thirsty.": "audio/68c8db6d5706.mp3",
    "Five of you. One round. Who goes to the bar?": "audio/776b622bb00e.mp3",
    "Five people, one round, half the bar. Everyone else is now watching your mate choose crisps.": "audio/c5313e4b3190.mp3",
    "Five of you, single file, buying one round. That's not a queue. That's a conga.": "audio/7f8750f421e6.mp3",
    "Correct. One round, one person, one gap. The rest of you find a table and start arguing about whose round is next.": "audio/2ea2b3f6088b.mp3",
    "Your last pint's nearly poured. What do you do while you wait?": "audio/322ee770dc57.mp3",
    "Correct. Card out while they pour. Tap. Beep. Done. The barperson is on to the next person before your pint has stopped fizzing.": "audio/cfba21eb74c4.mp3",
    "Every pocket. Then the coat. Then the other coat. That's three minutes nobody else at the bar gets served.": "audio/f74020d03532.mp3",
